<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>The macro for the game on Roblox called Locked perfoms a instant 180 and does formless.  I use 1980x1080 0.10 sensitivity and 900 dpi but you can reduce the rotate amount in the macro for your settings</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>MoveR -15800 -3200
Delay 20 ms
KeyDown 21 1
Delay 15 ms
RightDown 1
Delay 15 ms
KeyUp 21 1
Delay 15 ms
RightUp 1
MoveR 0 1300
MoveR 1050 0 2100 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Roblox</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>